# Origin of the Kurukuru backend.
#
# Only needed for the Vite dev server, where this app is served by Vite and the
# API is a different origin. In a packaged install the backend serves this
# bundle itself, so the app defaults to its own origin and needs no setting at
# all — which is also what keeps it working when the user changes the port.
#
# Set the ORIGIN, not the API path: the `/api` prefix is appended by
# src/api/client.ts, in one place, so it cannot drift from the backend's.
#
# The backend also needs to be told to allow this origin, since it ships with
# CORS closed:
#
#   KURUKURU_CORS_ORIGINS=["http://localhost:5173","http://127.0.0.1:5173"]
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:7842
